/T (Vashudevan Met Global LLP is a globally connected metal scrap trading company headquartered in Surat, Gujarat, India. We operate across major international markets including Asia, Europe, North America, South America, the Middle East and Africa. Our core expertise lies in sourcing, processing and delivering a wide range of non-ferrous and ferrous metal scrap that meets internationally accepted quality and compliance standards.)
/E (Vashudevan Met Global LLP is a globally connected metal scrap trading company headquartered in Surat, Gujarat, India. We operate across major international markets including Asia, Europe, North America, South America, the Middle East and Africa. Our core expertise lies in sourcing, processing and delivering a wide range of non-ferrous and ferrous metal scrap that meets internationally accepted quality and compliance standards.)
