/P 58 0 R
/T (At Vashudevan Met Global LLP, our philosophy is rooted in integrity, responsibility and long-term value creation. We believe that success in global metal recycling comes from transparent relationships, consistent quality and a commitment to doing what is right for our partners and the environment. Every decision we make is guided by a focus on sustainability, operational excellence and ethical business conduct. We aim to create meaningful impact by enabling the efficient reuse of resources while supporting industries with dependable, high-grade material. Our philosophy is simple: build trust, deliver value and contribute to a more sustainable world.)
